      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "The learned counsel for the Petitioner submits that the issue involved in the present Writ Petition is in respect of interpretation of section24(2) of the Right to Fair Compensation and Transparency in Land Acquisition, Rehabilitation and Resettlement Act, 2013.",
