      "text": "He submits that said issue has been pending before the Apex Court and in N.S. Kamble page 1 of 2 11-WP-8628-2016.doc view of the order dated 21.02.2018 passed bythe Apex Court in Special Leave Petition (Civil)No.8453/2017 (State of Haryana & Ors. Vs. M/s.G. D. Goenka Tourism Corporation Ltd. & Anr.),the matter is required to be adjourned.",
